an></li><li><span class="rf-year">334 CE</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/limigantes">Limigantes</a> revolt; Constantine settles Sarmatian refugees in the empire</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">c. 375 CE</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/huns">Huns</a> defeat the Alans and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/goths">Goths</a>, scattering the Sarmatian peoples</span></li></ol>
